---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="关于">
  <div class="article">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>About</p>
    <h1 data-reveal>你好，我是夜星河。</h1>
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p>这里是占位介绍，之后换成你自己的话：你是谁、在做什么、怎么联系你。</p>
      <p>这个站点用 Astro 构建，托管在 GitHub Pages，源码在 <a href="https://github.com/jimbetty/littlestarry">jimbetty/littlestarry</a>。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
